Node ID=1 Start Skills Tutorial 3
Text=You will see five main disciplines on the Character Skills Screen that you can choose from: Fighting, Thieving/Diplomacy, Divine Magic, Thought Magic, and Tribal Magic. Whenever you have Skill Points to spend, first select the discipline you want and then choose the specific skill you would like to improve.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me more about the skill disciplines.
Go to node ID=1 Skill Disciplines

