Node ID=1 Thief Skills Explanation
Text=These skills are the domain of the roguish adventurer. Within this discipline you can increase your Stealth skill, allowing you to sneak past enemies undetected, and also learn to detect secret doors or pick a lock. You can also improve your ability in Speech, allowing you to beguile, charm, and smooth talk your way out of difficult situations, and can learn to Barter, allowing you to get better prices from merchants.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me more about the other skill disciplines.
Go to node ID=1 Skill Disciplines

