Node ID=1 Tribal Magic Explanation
Text=Tribal Magic is the most diverse and versatile of the three magic disciplines. The different Spell Branches of the Tribal Magic Discipline let you tap into raw earth magic and command the forces of nature to do your bidding. Some spell groups allow you to conjure natural and unnatural monsters to your defense, or to charm creatures to assist you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

