Node ID=1 Spell Group Description
Text=Within each of three Magic Disciplines, there are several 'Spell Branches' that you can improve. By placing Skill Points into a Spell Branch you will improve all the spells within it. As you continue to apply more points to a Spell Branch, each of the spells within it becomes more powerful.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me more about the other skill disciplines.
