Node ID=1 Thought Magic Explanation
Text=Thought Magic relies on a focused mind to harness nature and unleash powerful elemental energies against your foes. The different spell groups within this discipline let you cast the most potent destructive magic, like spells that unleash terrible storms of fire, torrents of jagged ice, and thunderous bolts of lightning.
