Node ID=10 beast spirit
Text=I am a spirit born of primal nature and your flesh has been my cage these many years. During the time of the Disjunction, much of the world was thrown into chaos.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=10 beast spirit 2
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 beast spirit 2
Text=Amidst the great battle, I found strength in King Richard and joined with him. Ever since that time, I have slept in the blood of your family, Richard's family. And now I have awakened in you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=15 union
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=37 bastard child
Text=Though your blood is descended from his, you are not in line for the throne. Richard was a man of strong instincts and passions - during the crusades, he sired a large brood of children across the face of Europe. You are but one cub of a large pride.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 hunted
Text=I do not know. I have slumbered these many years and my senses are still dulled. There is much that I do not know. We should track down those that hunt us and learn why they seek to capture you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 lionheart
Text=I am a spirit that has lived in your family for generations, ever since I joined with your ancestor King Richard the Lionhearted. I have slumbered for many years within your bloodline, waiting for a scion as worthy as Richard. I sense that you *could* be the one I have been waiting for.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=King Richard? Does that mean I am an heir to the throne?
Go to node ID=37 bastard child

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions.
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial

Requirement=!None
