Node ID=30 Azi Dahaka
Text=Azi Dahaka is a storm demon and one of the strongest of the Daeva. He has grown large on a diet of *entire* armies. He is an enemy of your kind and one of the greatest forces of evil on this wayward planet. This will be the most dangerous opponent you have faced yet.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=How can this creature be defeated?
Go to node ID=30 defeat dragon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Could it be possible to convince Azi Dahaka to let us pass?
