Node ID=400 tawrich
Text=Tawrich is the Daeva of Hunger, a powerful demon with a ravenous appetite for mortal flesh that is never sated. Throughout history, he has bonded with conquerors and raiders, seeking to devour the world. He has had many names. Buddhists call him Pretas and Rome knew him as Fames, but all know him as suffering.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is a Daeva?
Go to node ID=500 daevas explanation beast

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough. Let's continue on.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=400 khan demon
Text=<Sniff> There is a stench within this cave. This is the lair of a great predator, one that has a hunger unmatched by any animal. My instincts tell me that it is Tawrich, the Devourer. If so, do not charge blindly into this encounter. Be cunning, and prepare yourself for a vicious opponent.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who is Tawrich?
Go to node ID=400 tawrich

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough. Let's continue on.
