Node ID=500 daevas explanation beast
Text=The Daevas are powerful demons whose purpose is to cause strife and spread evil across the world. Each Daeva is unique and possesses dreadful power. For as long as I can remember, they have fought the Divine Spirits in a senseless war that I have tried, sometimes unsuccessfully, to avoid.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me about the Divine Spirits.
Go to node ID=500 divine spirit explanation beast

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough. Let's continue on.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=500 divine spirit explanation beast
Text=Divine Spirits have opposed the Daevas since humankind first knew good from evil. Humans have given them many names throughout time. In the south they are known as the guardian Ombwiri. In the west they are Cherubim and in the east, Kurabi. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=500 divine spirit explanation beast part 2
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=500 divine spirit explanation beast part 2
Text=Each Divine Spirit represents a virtue and possesses the power of some aspect of good. But to me, they are no better or no different than the Daevas - good and evil are but two sides of one coin.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is a Daeva?
Go to node ID=500 daevas explanation beast

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough. Let's continue on.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye after warning
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=600 wizard tremblethorn aka manah
Text=<Growls> Betrayal and temptation pervade these caves. This is the work of a powerful Daeva, Aka Manah, known in your tongue as the Evil Mind. He is always seeking to tempt and corrupt the credulous and weak-willed. Guard your body and mind against this foe.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who is Aka Manah?
Go to node ID=600 Aka Manah

