------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=600 aka manah
Text=Aka Manah is a treacherous Daeva. He is the personification of destructive temptation. Those that are fooled by his seductions become little more than slaves to his addictions. Resist his calling and stay true to your heart.
Should Have Voiceover=1

