Node ID=700 old man warning
Text=Hold, Scion of Lionheart. There is a very powerful spirit near to us. I sense something almost familiar, but... mysterious. Be prepared, I believe this is the foe that has been seeking us out.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=750 name
Text=I have been called both demonic and divine in my long history. Far to the east I was called Raiju, the thunder beast, in the New World I took the form of the Coyote to teach and beguile. My ancient name is...best not spoken, but know that I have left the great struggle and now serve the *balance*.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
