Node ID=750 good and evil
Text=Such concepts of good and evil are unknown to animals, though they can appear unmercifully cruel or loyally protective at their whim. It is said mortals that fail to achieve perfection in life, return as animals in their next life to help the balance, such is the natural order of things. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial
