Node ID=1100 Found Mana
Text=That blue spirit you just absorbed is a spirit let loose by the Disjunction. I...we...can obtain Mana energy from such a spirit. During our travels, we will find many of them to boost our magic power. While they evade the sight of most people, your keen eye can spot them.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1101 Found Health
Text=While you are bound to me, you can gather these lost souls to replenish your life energies. It is the way of nature that things die and leave their remains for the strong to consume.
Should Have Voiceover=1
